* ADP7118 3.3V to 1.8V LDO Circuit

* Input Voltage Source
VIN IN 0 3.3

* Input Decoupling Capacitor (2.2uF recommended minimum)
CIN IN 0 2.2u

* LDO Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin Order: IN EN GND SS BYP ADJ OUT
XU1 IN IN 0 SS BYP ADJ OUT ADP7118

* Soft-Start and Bypass Capacitors
CSS SS 0 1n
CBYP BYP 0 1u

* Output Decoupling Capacitor (2.2uF recommended minimum)
COUT OUT 0 2.2u

* Feedback Resistor Divider (Vref = 1.2V)
* VOUT = 1.2V * (1 + R1/R2) => 1.8V = 1.2V * (1 + 50k/100k)
R1 OUT ADJ 50k
R2 ADJ 0 100k

* 50mA Resistive Load (1.8V / 50mA = 36 ohms)
RLOAD OUT 0 36

* Library Inclusion
.lib ADP7102.lib

* Transient Analysis (5ms to allow for soft-start and settling)
.tran 5m

.end
